---
const states = [
  { label: 't = 0', amplitude: 0 },
  { label: 't = π/2', amplitude: 1 },
  { label: 't = π', amplitude: 0 },
  { label: 't = 3π/2', amplitude: -1 },
];
const curve = (a: number) =>
  Array.from({ length: 81 }, (_, i) => {
    const x = (i * Math.PI) / 80;
    return `${i ? 'L' : 'M'} ${24 + i * 2.65} ${82 - 48 * a * Math.sin(x)}`;
  }).join(' ');
---

<figure class="wave-states">
  <div class="states">
    {states.map(({ label, amplitude }) => (
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 260 158"
        role="img"
        aria-label={`${label}: amplitude ${amplitude} do perfil seno`}
      >
        <text x="130" y="18" text-anchor="middle">
          {label}
        </text>
        <line x1="24" y1="82" x2="236" y2="82" class="axis" />
        <line x1="24" y1="29" x2="24" y2="135" class="axis" />
        <path d={curve(amplitude)} class="profile" />
        <text x="8" y="38">
          1
        </text>
        <text x="3" y="134">
          −1
        </text>
        <text x="24" y="153">
          0
        </text>
        <text x="229" y="153">
          π
        </text>
        <text x="242" y="86">
          x
        </text>
      </svg>
    ))}
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    u(x, t) = sin(x) sin(t). A corda parte da posição de equilíbrio, sobe, volta
    à posição de equilíbrio e desce. Em t = 0 e t = π tem a mesma posição, mas
    velocidades opostas.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .states {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font:
      15px 'Manrope Variable',
      sans-serif;
  }
  .axis {
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .profile {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  figcaption {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .states {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
